"O controle pelo Claude está desligado. No app, clique em 🤖 Claude (no topo) e ligue \"Permitir que o Claude controle o app\".": "Control by Claude is off. In the app, click 🤖 Claude (at the top) and turn on \"Allow Claude to control the app\".",
